---
// src/components/WhatIs.astro
---

<div id="que-es" class="py-24 bg-white">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16">
      <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 bg-corporate-blue-100 text-corporate-blue-700 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold mb-6">
        EL SISTEMA INTEGRAL
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-display font-bold text-corporate-gray-900 mb-6">
        Un ERP diseñado para <span class="text-corporate-blue-600">empresas colombianas</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-corporate-gray-600 font-light">
        AMS Inventory's centraliza ventas, inventario, facturación, alquileres, suscripciones, caja y más en una sola plataforma web multi-empresa.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Left Column - Content -->
      <div>
        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div class="flex items-start space-x-5">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-corporate-blue-500 to-corporate-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-corporate">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4" />
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-corporate-gray-900 mb-3">Todo en un solo sistema</h3>
              <p class="text-corporate-gray-600">
                15 módulos integrados que comparten datos en tiempo real: una venta actualiza el stock, registra el ingreso en caja y genera la factura automáticamente.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start space-x-5">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-teal-500 to-accent-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-corporate">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" />
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-corporate-gray-900 mb-3">Multi-empresa con aislamiento total</h3>
              <p class="text-corporate-gray-600">
                Arquitectura multi-tenant: cada empresa opera en su propio espacio completamente aislado. Ideal para grupos empresariales o para ofrecer el sistema como servicio.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start space-x-5">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-corporate-gray-700 to-corporate-gray-800 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-corporate">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-corporate-gray-900 mb-3">Control de acceso por roles</h3>
              <p class="text-corporate-gray-600">
                Cada usuario solo ve y puede hacer lo que su rol permite: Administrador, Vendedor, Bodega o Contabilidad. Con registro de auditoría de todas las acciones del sistema.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column - Real feature breakdown -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-corporate-blue-50 to-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-corporate-blue-100 shadow-corporate">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-corporate-gray-900 mb-6">Módulos incluidos</h3>

        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-corporate-gray-100">
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-corporate-gray-800">Ventas (POS)</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold">Incluido</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-corporate-gray-100">
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-corporate-gray-800">Inventario / Kardex</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold">Incluido</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-corporate-gray-100">
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-corporate-gray-800">Alquileres</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold">Incluido</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-corporate-gray-100">
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-corporate-gray-800">Suscripciones</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold">Incluido</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-corporate-gray-100">
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-corporate-gray-800">Créditos / Cartera</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold">Incluido</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-corporate-gray-100">
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-corporate-gray-800">Facturación</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold">Incluido</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-corporate-gray-100">
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-corporate-gray-800">Caja y movimientos</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold">Incluido</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-corporate-gray-100">
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-corporate-gray-800">Compras y Proveedores</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold">Incluido</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-corporate-gray-100">
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-corporate-gray-800">Reportes y Dashboard</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold">Incluido</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-corporate-gray-100">
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-corporate-gray-800">Auditoría de actividad</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold">Incluido</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-corporate-blue-200">
          <p class="text-sm text-corporate-gray-600 text-center">
            Todos los módulos están disponibles desde el primer día, sin costos adicionales por módulo.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
